            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The exchanges of the barge manufacturing are derived from an assessment of one barge, with a load capacity of 2800t. This data was adjusted to model a barge, representing the current average total capacity for solid goods transports (1000 tonnes/barge). Energy consumption in manufacturing was estimated as 50% of the cumulative energy of the used materials. The split of energies is 10% electricity and 90% heavy fuel oil.;
UUID: 789a5d04-1198-3e33-845d-14b3f6808fc9</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
